    "detailed_description": "The most fun &amp; challenging Clutter yet, with over 2800 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days. So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/3b02e2952cb998dc2d57aa3a8e752b69.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br>This Collector's Edition has 15% more puzzles and additional bonus materials.<br>Bonus area includes the very popular Box Songs variation, Crazy Singletons &amp; Circular Abstratica.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/4c4df45683d1f95214cbea95d77e76c0.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br>As always, the Clutter levels are highly addicting and replayable.<br>In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes with a new Variation.<br>And wait until you see the Dice &amp; Icon Puzzles.<br>You've never seen Clutter this fun &amp; challenging.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/2a8ebd472760cb59769ba339a4b136c7.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br>And as always, the options let you play Clutter the way you want.<br>And Favorites allow you can collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/bbfa71bc12b6f0835e7bfde1a924bd5d.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes<br></li><li>Over 2800 levels and a very challenging 100 level Main Quest<br></li><li>An extra hard Dice Quest and a No-Motion Old-School Quest<br></li><li>Hundreds of picture puzzles and 300 new Box Quotes puzzles<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability<br></li><li>Another Great Soundtrack with a Cinematic Feel.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/bbfa71bc12b6f0835e7bfde1a924bd5d.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "The most fun &amp; challenging Clutter yet, with over 2800 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days. So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/3b02e2952cb998dc2d57aa3a8e752b69.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br>This Collector's Edition has 15% more puzzles and additional bonus materials.<br>Bonus area includes the very popular Box Songs variation, Crazy Singletons &amp; Circular Abstratica.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/4c4df45683d1f95214cbea95d77e76c0.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br>As always, the Clutter levels are highly addicting and replayable.<br>In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes with a new Variation.<br>And wait until you see the Dice &amp; Icon Puzzles.<br>You've never seen Clutter this fun &amp; challenging.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/2a8ebd472760cb59769ba339a4b136c7.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br>And as always, the options let you play Clutter the way you want.<br>And Favorites allow you can collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/bbfa71bc12b6f0835e7bfde1a924bd5d.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes<br></li><li>Over 2800 levels and a very challenging 100 level Main Quest<br></li><li>An extra hard Dice Quest and a No-Motion Old-School Quest<br></li><li>Hundreds of picture puzzles and 300 new Box Quotes puzzles<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability<br></li><li>Another Great Soundtrack with a Cinematic Feel.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418500/extras/bbfa71bc12b6f0835e7bfde1a924bd5d.avif?t=1726773781\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "By far, the most challenging and exciting Clutter ever. You will not believe the Dice, Flat-Pastel-Icons &amp; the Abstractica Object Sets. And 3 Quests - Regular, Super-Difficult The Diceman Cometh Quest, and Super-Easy Oldschool Quest.",
